   "author": "Ben Scott",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/benscott22_lawyer-preference-for-ai-grounded-in-legal-activity-7509883138010083328-3jlQ",
   "text": "The headline isn't simply that 94% of lawyers now use AI. It\u2019s that as adoption becomes normal so trust, transparency and human oversight are becoming buying criteria!\n\nThat raises an evidential question we\u2019re focused on at Etched:\n\nWhat does \u201chuman oversight\u201d actually look like if somebody needs to prove it later?\n\nWhich source material went in, which AI system was used, what came back, what was verified, what the lawyer changed and who ultimately approved the work? Well put Laura Halls and Dylan Brown\n\nA policy can require oversight. The creation record can evidence that it happened.\n\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/e9SP6DqS\n\nWell put Laura Halls and Dylan Brown",
