   "text": "These are the VCs that made\u00a0the\u00a0most AI investments from 2025 until now:\n\nSource: Multiples, data as of 28 Sep 2026\n\n1. Andreessen Horowitz \u2014 122 AI investments, 40% of all deals 2025-26 \u2014  key AI holdings include OpenAI, Databricks, Cognition and Safe Superintelligence. Famously missed Anthropic\n2. General Catalyst \u2014 122 AI investments, 38% of all deals 2025-26 \u2014 backer of Anthropic, Mistral, Cognition and defence AI software Helsing.\n3. Sequoia Capital \u2014 116 AI investments, 47% of all deals 2025-26 \u2014 positions in Anthropic, OpenAI, chip designer Etched and Fireworks AI.\n4. Khosla Ventures \u2014 102 AI investments, 50% of all deals 2025-26 \u2014 holdings include Cognition, Lovable, Abridge and Fact",
